OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder over north
OL,4,ABelfast shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 41-year-old man has been charged with
OL,7,Fthe murder of Robbie Lawlor, who was
OL,8,Fshot dead in north Belfast.
OL,10,FLawlor, 36, who was from Dublin and
OL,11,Fbelieved to have been involved in
OL,12,Forganised crime in the Republic of
OL,13,FIreland, was shot multiple times
OL,14,Foutside a house in Etna Drive in
OL,15,FArdoyne in April 2020.
OL,17,FThe man, who was arrested in Liverpool
OL,18,Fon Wednesday, has also been charged
OL,19,Fwith possession of a firearm or
OL,20,Fammunition with intent to endanger life
OL,21,For cause serious damage to property.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
